    [
     24.036000000000005,
     30.863000000000007,
     "place"
    ]
   ],
   "text": "And you'd never meet just one. A pod hunts as a team, and you'd be outnumbered. In Antarctica, a pod charges an ice floe together, and the wave washes the seal straight off. You'd go too.",
   "role": "",
   "key": 2,
   "chords": [
