    [
     32.31300000000001,
     42.70300000000001,
     "place"
    ]
   ],
   "text": "Off South Africa, the shark you're scared of started washing up missing one organ. The liver. Orcas flipped them and took it. The surviving great whites fled for months. If they run, what chance do you have?",
   "role": "",
   "key": 2,
