   "variant": 0,
   "segs": [
    [
     51.42900000000001,
     63.09200000000001,
     "board"
    ]
   ],
   "text": "So why has something this fast and this smart never come for you? Maybe you taste bad? Nobody's ever proven that. Too small to bother with? You're about the size of the seals they eat. The best answer is culture.",
   "role": "",
   "key": 2,
   "chords": [
